    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Description:\r\n\r\nNo. 13 Church View, two storey 3 bed semi-detached residence only minutes’ walk from Ballymahon Town Centre. \r\n\r\nThis 3-bed residence extends to c.92 sq.m. with a tarmac driveway to the front and a large rear garden. The bright entrance hall flows into a living room, a dining / Kitchen and a bathroom. Upstairs the accommodation includes 3 bedrooms, ensuite and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis generous family home is located in a wonderful sought-after family friendly residential area with a host of services and amenities on its doorstep.\r\n\r\nViewing Highly Recommended\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n•\tElectric Storage Heating\r\n•\tuPVC Windows & Doors.\r\n•\tOff Street Parking\r\n•\tSought after location.\r\n•\tClose to all amenities"
      },
      {
